  "usage_notes": [
    "Voice IDs are determined by the hook in this priority order:",
    "1. Explicit VOICE: tag in assistant message",
    "2. [AGENT:name] tag from COMPLETED message",
    "3. Skill name from skill context",
    "4. Default voice",
    "",
    "To create custom voices:",
    "- Go to https://elevenlabs.io/app/voice-lab",
    "- Clone or create a voice",
    "- Copy the voice ID from voice settings",
    "- Add to this configuration file",
    "",
    "Voice settings explanation:",
    "- stability: 0.0 (variable/expressive) to 1.0 (stable/consistent)",
    "- similarity_boost: 0.0 (creative) to 1.0 (accurate to original)",
    "- style: 0.0 (neutral) to 1.0 (exaggerated) - only some voices",
    "- use_speaker_boost: true enhances clarity"
  ]
}
